    "title": "Little Brown Church to celebrate anniversary - NewsBreak",
    "text": "13 hours ago The congregation of the Little Brown Church, 2128 County Road 608, Poplar Bluff, will celebrate the 50th anniversary of the church being in its current building at 9:45 a.m. Sunday, April 19. Special guest singers will be the Gloryland Quartet of Paragould, Arkansas. The church was established in the 1930s... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
